    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carrot Cake is an Easter Horror game following a group of kids in an Easter theme park. Compete in the Easter games, solve puzzles, and escape the facility in this PSX style survival horror.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Easter Bunny has set up a fun-filled event of games, prizes, and laughter for all kids around! Parents drop off their kids for a day of egg hunting, fun challenges, and competing for a prize! But this vibrant event has a dark secret. Can you escape before becoming the next missing child?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Deadly Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usually games like Egg Hunts, Hide and Seek, Chasing Chickens, and Painting Easter Eggs are innocent and fun. But here there's a loser and a winner. Make sure you're not the loser.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the pastel colored walls are the keys to your survival. Search for clues, crack codes, and unlock hidden areas before time runs out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Easter Bunny</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't trust the Easter Bunny mascot or his friends. Kids are going missing and you're running out of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Now... Before It's Too Late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carrot Cake is an Easter Horror game following a group of kids in an Easter theme park. Compete in the Easter games, solve puzzles, and escape the facility in this PSX style survival horror.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Easter Bunny has set up a fun-filled event of games, prizes, and laughter for all kids around! Parents drop off their kids for a day of egg hunting, fun challenges, and competing for a prize! But this vibrant event has a dark secret. Can you escape before becoming the next missing child?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Deadly Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usually games like Egg Hunts, Hide and Seek, Chasing Chickens, and Painting Easter Eggs are innocent and fun. But here there's a loser and a winner. Make sure you're not the loser.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the pastel colored walls are the keys to your survival. Search for clues, crack codes, and unlock hidden areas before time runs out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Easter Bunny</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't trust the Easter Bunny mascot or his friends. Kids are going missing and you're running out of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist Now... Before It's Too Late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
